  "body": "The `initial` value of [`-webkit-background-clip`](https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#the-webkit-background-clip-property) is `none` but it is missing from its `value` definition.\r\n\r\n> **Name**: `-webkit-background-clip`\r\n> **Value:** `border-box | padding-box | content-box | text`\r\n> **Initial:** `none`\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
